; Short aliases of the English AutoCAD for the dimensions of the 0.8 ([0.8.1-RT3], work #930):
; DAL DIMALIGNED, DAN DIMANGULAR, DRA DIMRADIUS, DDI DIMDIAMETER (alias column of
; docs/parita/comandi.md; DECISIONI.md, 2026-11-21, point 6). Each alias answers its first
; prompt, then Esc leaves nothing. DAN with Enter: in the 0.8 only lines, so
; "Object selected is not a line." and the prompt again (PT27 card of the 0.8, point 1;
; as in dimangular/non-linea). DRA and DDI pick the circle 0,0 radius 10 at 10,0, as in
; dimradius/cerchio. The alias DAL at Command: is the boundary of the pending case.
CIRCLE
0,0
10
DAL
0,0
!esc
DAN

!esc
DRA
10,0
!esc
DDI
10,0
!esc
